--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 4b3f2a8c8f344355b16a4d4296ae3f98, type: 3}
  m_Name: Serpent
  m_EditorClassIdentifier:
  vesselClass: 7
  entries:
  - Element: 1
    AbilityLabel: Sniper Shot
    AbilityDescription: 'Scoped, the right trigger fires a single hitscan round down the scope''s
      own line that destroys what it hits - including SUPER-SHIELDED mass, which only the
      Rhino''s energised blade could touch before. Charge sets the RECOVERY: the wait between
      shots, 12s at rest down to 5.4s at Charge 10. The shot spends no resource and carries no
      ammunition, so the cooldown IS its whole cost.'
    Input: 1
    MultiplierAtFullLevel: 1
    MinMultiplier: 1
    UnlockLevel: 5
    RelockBelowLevel: 4
    LatchPolicy: 0
    UpgradeLabel: Pierce
    UpgradeDescription: 'The round no longer stops at the first prism - it carries through up
      to three, super-shielded or not, in one shot. Gated on the REPLICATED unlock bit rather
      than a local level read, because it decides how much mass dies and every peer has to
      agree.'
  - Element: 2
    AbilityLabel: (open design slot)
    AbilityDescription: Mass mapping not yet designed for the Serpent.
    Input: 0
    MultiplierAtFullLevel: 1
    MinMultiplier: 1
    UnlockLevel: 5
    RelockBelowLevel: 4
    LatchPolicy: 0
    UpgradeLabel: 
    UpgradeDescription: 
  - Element: 3
    AbilityLabel: Scope
    AbilityDescription: 'Hold the left trigger and the view drops into the cockpit and magnifies
      with the trigger''s own depth - an analog dial, not a toggle - while the right trigger
      becomes the Sniper Shot. Space sets the MAGNIFICATION: 22 degrees of field of view at full
      zoom at rest, narrowing to 11 at Space 10, floored at 8 so the scope can never become a
      soda straw. Reach is Space''s job fleet-wide and a scope''s whole claim is reach.'
    Input: 2
    MultiplierAtFullLevel: 1
    MinMultiplier: 1
    UnlockLevel: 5
    RelockBelowLevel: 4
    LatchPolicy: 0
    UpgradeLabel: Steady Eye
    UpgradeDescription: 'Below the upgrade the zoom BLEEDS OFF as the pilot turns - hauling the
      stick over eases the magnification back out, so a scoped Serpent is committed to a line and
      has to settle before it can take a long shot. At Space 5 the bleed is gone and the scope
      holds through any manoeuvre.'
  - Element: 4
    AbilityLabel: Boost Duration
    AbilityDescription: Time extends the boost duration.
    Input: 6
    MultiplierAtFullLevel: 1.6
    MinMultiplier: 0.25
    UnlockLevel: 5
    RelockBelowLevel: 4
    LatchPolicy: 0
    UpgradeLabel: 
    UpgradeDescription: 
